         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">CALIBRATED INPUTS PROCESSING INPUTS VC PORTAMENTO CONTROL The Serge Modular Systems NEW TIMBRAL OSCILLATOR (NTO) is the state-of-the-art VCO, featuring exceptional range, superb temperature stability, and accurate tracking. Dynamic depth frequency</rdf:li>
